. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:8\" href=\"/Numbers.13.8\">Nu 13:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:16\" href=\"/Numbers.13.16\">16</a> (𝔊 Αὑση) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.44\">Dt 32:44</a> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς)."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> a Bethshemite <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.14\">1 S 6:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.18\">18</a> (𝔊 Ὡσηε, A Ἰησοῦς, 𝔊L Ἰωσηε)."}], "all_cited": true, "num": "2."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "h.p. after the restoration, son of Jehozadak <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:1\" href=\"/Haggai.1.1\">Hg 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:12\" href=\"/Haggai.1.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:14\" href=\"/Haggai.1.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:2\" href=\"/Haggai.2.2\">2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:4\" href=\"/Haggai.2.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.1\">Zc 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.11\">6:11</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" href=\"/Ezra.2.2\">Ezr 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:2\" href=\"/Ezra.3.2\">3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:8\" href=\"/Ezra.3.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:3\" href=\"/Ezra.4.3\">4:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" href=\"/Ezra.10.18\">10:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.7\">Ne 7:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.1\">12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.26\">26</a>."}], "all_cited": true, "num": "3."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> governor of Jerusalem under Josiah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.8\">2 K 23:8</a> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς, 𝔊L Ἰωσηε)."}], "all_cited": true, "num": "4."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) head of one of the classes of priests <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.11\">1 Ch 24:11</a>, possibly also <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" href=\"/Ezra.2.36\">Ezr 2:36</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.38\">Ne 7:39</a>."}], "all_cited": true, "num": "5."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς, etc.), a Levitical family-name of frequent occurrence:"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ezr 2:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:9\" href=\"/Ezra.3.9\">3:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\">Ne 7:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.10\">10:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.8\">12:8</a>."}], "num": "a."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.15\">2 Ch 31:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.24\">Ne 12:24</a>."}], "num": "b."}], "all_cited": true, "num": "6."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 <em>id.</em>), father of a builder at the wall <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">Ne 3:19</a>, perhaps ="}], "all_cited": true, "num": "7."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "a Judaite family-name (𝔊 <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:6\" href=\"/Ezra.2.6\">Ezr 2:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.11\">Ne 7:11</a